{"ref":"BDB, אֲרַוְנָה","hw":"אֲרַוְנָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַוְנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. Araunah</strong>, a Jebusite—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.20\">2 S 24:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.23\">23</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶבֶד אֲדֹוֹנִי</span> cf. We Dr) v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:24\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.24\">24</a>; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּרֶן האורנה</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.16\">16</a> (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאֲרַוְנָה</span>) c.art. but cf. Dr; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ ארניה</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.18\">18</a> (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַוְנָה</span>); = <span dir=\"rtl\">אָרְנָן</span> (q.v.) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.15\">1 Ch 21:15 f</a>; 𝔊 in S & Ch Ὀρνα.","next":"BDB, ארז","prev":"BDB, אֲרוּמָה"}